#. y1:english="What should I do now?{PA:10}||Hey, what do you think I should do?\nWhat's the problem?\nI'm in debt,{PA:20} I keep getting dumped||by men and I can't go home...\nMaybe I have no other choice||but to go to this park...\nYou shouldn't go there.\n...Huh?\nThat place isn't for women or kids.\n...If you got that kind of determination,||why don't you give it another shot?\nYeah... {PA:20}Maybe so...{PA:20}||I'll do that.\nThank you for your advice.\nDecide yourself.\nI see...\nI have no other alternative||but to go to the park...\nThanks for talking to me.\nWhatever.\nI see...\nIt doesn't matter whether||I'm in this city or not.\n...I'll think it out a little more before||I decide."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN:79_0_18
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN::line:79_0_18"
msgid "... Me lo pensaré un poco||antes de decidirme."
msgstr ""

