#. y1:english="Hello.||I'm calling on behalf of YKO Service.\nI'd like to inform you||that your loan payment is overdue.\n\nOh, really?||I'm sorry.\nClick...{PA:15} Beep, beep...\n\nI'm afraid that your loan payment||for the amount of\n240,000 yen has been overdue for 10 days.\nIf you can,||please pay it within today.\nUmm, yes.||Sir, many people say that.\nHowever,{PA:10} if you don't pay||the amount within today...\nwe'll have to send someone||to collect the money...\nAre you okay with that?\nI see... Do you realise your identity||has been thoroughly checked out?\nWill you still not agree to pay?\nYou're a very stubborn man.||Where are you right now?\n\n...It's West Park, isn't it?\nWell, if you refuse to pay up,||we're gonna have to resort to plan B.\nWe're gonna hire some||professional debt collectors.\nYou know||What a professional debt collector does?\nWhy don't you just hurry up||and pay for your sake?\n\nOkay,||you'll be sorry.\nThen I guess I'll have to take the||necessary procedures. Good luck.\nClick... Beep, beep...\n\nI understand.||Where are you now, sir?\n\nIn that case, please bring 240,000 yen||to the entrance of West Park.\nIf you don't,{PA:10} a 100,000 yen||overdue penalty will be charged,\nand we'll have to send someone||to collect the money in person.\nGood bye. Click...||Click... Beep, beep...\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN:88_2_25
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN::line:88_2_25"
msgid "Entonces supongo que tendré que llevar||a cabo los procedimientos necesarios."
msgstr ""

