#. y1:english="You... {PA:20}What do you want?\nAya... {PA:20}Isn't that the name of your daughter?\nYeah... {PA:20}So what?\nShe's at the exit to Purgatory.{PA:20}||She's been looking for you.\n...I know. {PA:20}How could I not recognize her?\nBut there's no point for her||seeing me this way.\nI heard you disappeared.{PA:20}||What happened to you exactly?\n...I embezzled money from the company.\nBefore I was exposed,{PA:10}||I got divorced and ran away.\nThis was several years ago...\nWhat happened to the money?\nMy boss caught me embezzling the company,||took the money for himself and then told me{PA:20}\n\"If you don't wanna get arrested,||you should disappear...\"\nHey, {PA:10}you...\nWhen Aya talks about her father,\nshe usually has a sad look on her face.\nShe can't seem to be able to||control her feelings.\n...It's completely up to you||how you're going to live your life.\nBut it's your duty as a father to show||your face, {PA:20}so that she can feel reassured.\nBut...\nThere's nothing to argue about.\nIf you still refuse to see Aya,||I'll take you to see her by force.\nYou...\nGo. {PA:20}All you have to do is show up,||and answer her questions.\nImagine how much of a relief||it will be for her, just to see you.\n...You're a good man.\nI think I understand now,||why our boss likes you.\n...Go.\nYeah. {PA:20}Alright.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN:92_0_18
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN::line:92_0_18"
msgid "Pero es tu obligación como padre verla,{PA:10}||para que se sienta mejor."
msgstr ""

