#. y1:english="Asshole... I'll never let you||take my Erina-chan away from me....\nYaoi-san! Stop it!\nDon't ever come near me again...!\nWhat? E... Erina-chan?\nKazuma-san is...\nmy fiance!\nYou... you're lying! Tell me you're joking!\nIt's true...||So, please. Don't ever come near me.\nI never wanna see your face again...\nE... Erina-chan...||Okay. I understand...\nGood bye... Yaoi-san.\nHey, you Yakuza asshole!\n...If you ever make Erina-chan cry,||you'll have hell to pay!\nAnd...\nyour punches were pretty powerful||even though I was wearing this.\nYou received Chain Mail.\n\nGood bye!"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN:97_2_17
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN::line:97_2_17"
msgid "iAdiós!"
msgstr ""

