#. y1:english="Ah, buddy. I think I'm getting that warm,||fuzzy feeling in my chest.\nI wanna share it with you.\nWell, I came down||with a stomachache the other day.\nBut the people in this town||were just passing me by\nwithout paying any attention to me,||as usual.\nBut there was an angel,||even in this town.\nAn angel?\nYeah.||She looked just like any other girl...\nBut she carried me on her back,\nand took me to a hospital, all by herself.\nThat's not an easy task.\nLooks can be deceiving...\nTrue.\nShe told me||she works at a hostess bar called Jewel.\nBuddy, please select her,||if you don't mind.\nHer name's Chisa.\nIf I could,\nI would spend all the money||in the world on her...\nHumph. You have no heart..."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN:98_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0054.BIN::line:98_0_0"
msgid "Ah, colega. Creo que tengo ese||sentimiento cálido y extraño en el pecho."
msgstr ""

